{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine rocks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep on Mining! is a simple incremental game. Hover your cursor over rocks to automatically mine them. Any rock inside the mining area will spawn pickaxes that mine for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather materials!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mined rocks drop ores, which are crafted into bars. There is a variety of different material rocks to be mined!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The skill tree!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your material bars to unlock upgrades inside the skill tree. These upgrades permanently boost your stats, letting you mine rocks with more power!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft pickaxes!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different materials to craft new pickaxes. Each new pickaxe has better stats, helping you mine faster and hit harder!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talent cards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you level up, you earn a talent point. Spend talent points to reveal 3 random talent cards \u2014 pick one to keep! Choosing a card increases the talent level, but also increases rock HP.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Mine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you unlock the mine, it will automatically mine rocks and instantly craft bars for you. The Mine is the idle mechanic of Keep on Mining!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mine a rock.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/841e477f039e3de035a9753ea250175c4d4244dc.jpg"},{"name":"Mine a lot of rocks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/841e477f039e3de035a9753ea250175c4d4244dc.jpg"},{"name":"Copper!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/a636a47c2706bd7f00b642921cd4f9432be007a4.jpg"},{"name":"All materials unlocked!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/4a4b217c83f5c8af80d765c30a607d018c56fd90.jpg"},{"name":"Beams, explosions and balls!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/690c4266a1d6362dbc6c3518ed12f8c2656d3e01.jpg"},{"name":"Everything purchased!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/a008f51362e2704c2beddd307f2bc5bf8ad97cb7.jpg"},{"name":"Pick a card, any card.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/3474d67b1cbc2d7e9ebbda17004acf7b21232d24.jpg"},{"name":"Card collector.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/f82203fa6ee65e78941f54189b18845a342a7746.jpg"},{"name":"First we mine.. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/3f13eb6851ede0eb0f70201cbc7bd4c95aecc911.jpg"},{"name":"Then we craft!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3769130/5d0f836c97d87d868a2532224f404dff02cc6cad.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769130?t=1758806311","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769130?t=1758806311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/c46dfa8827a8d86625e4c5cc5c1292844c75215a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758806311","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/c46dfa8827a8d86625e4c5cc5c1292844c75215a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758806311","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine rocks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline